{"server":"cn","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_06_beg","groupId":"act45side","stageId":"act45side_06","title":"回声飘荡的大厅","storyCode":"SS-6","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b5700b6b69368cd39259f061bd37d3512fe4bd90dd7c5d28bba5e96306f2169a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"祥子狼狈地回到梦城堡中，莫菲丝嘲笑祥子一次次的失败，Ave{@nbs}Mujica没有一个人想和她回到现实。莫菲丝表示自己为祥子准备了一个绝佳的梦境。祥子重新回到了执行罗德岛外勤任务时所乘坐的车里，本以为只是曾经的梦境的重演，却发现这次的梦境出现了偏差。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"寒风在耳边呼啸而过。\n下坠，越来越快。\n可深渊仍不见底。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我那些强人所难的要求，除了你还有其他鼓手能满足吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是我见过的，最努力的鼓手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明......只需要做你自己就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在各个组织间忙碌，却找不到一个真正的落脚点......这就是你想要的生活吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你本不该承受这种痛苦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海铃，和我一起离开吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g4_islandharbor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定要找到你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"初华......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睦，这里不是现实，我们现在应该......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"砰——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g2_dreamcastlehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"急促的心跳，失控的呼吸，还有背脊上的冷汗。\n知觉再次回到了祥子体内，却是以这种狼狈不堪的方式。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很真实吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从不知道多高的地方，向地面坠落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有梦境破碎，被困在“无梦之境”又无法逃脱......感觉如何呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使那些梦都是美梦，它们也不该继续下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"窥窃她们心里最脆弱的部分，再将它们不断编排演绎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不这么认为哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你闯进她们的梦前，她们几乎就要忘记你，还有那个根本无足轻重的乐队了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ave{@nbs}Mujica是我们的契约，她们把人生托付给了我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在乎它的只有你一个人吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是都亲耳听见了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们一个个，全都拒绝了你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不要。这里的人爱着身为女演员的我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我为了这些，拼尽了一切......结果你告诉我这些全是假的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么荒唐话，我不可能接受！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是我的梦境，只有我自己就好了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么可能懂我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的生活就很好......这样更适合我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不需要谁来拯救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也没有人能救我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g4_islandharbor_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“睦”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"果然，小睦根本不需要祥子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g2_dreamcastlehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈......哈哈哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你所有狼狈、无助、可笑的时刻，我全都看在眼里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然之前你毁了我造的梦境，但这样一来一回，咱们也算是扯平了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外还要谢谢你，在她们的梦里一次又一次穿梭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我证明——我创造的梦境就是完美无缺、无可挑剔的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在那个家伙也该承认，我才是梦城堡里最有天赋的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个家伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是在梦里见过她吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"穿着贵族小姐般华丽的衣服，嘴里说着一些老掉牙的客套话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"待在她的身边，简直让人坐立难安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爱丽丝才是这里的主人，你不过是个冒牌货！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她说过，再美好的梦，最后也应该醒来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子只觉得自己的声带被凝住，无法发出任何的声音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我终于知道你为什么让我生厌了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和她一样，从骨子里听不进别人的想法，嘴里也永远都是那些假大空的说辞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说什么托付了人生，其实是不想自己被人舍弃吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看过你的人生，不过就是大小姐落魄后的不甘和挣扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的每一个举动，无非就是在欺骗和说服自己，并且不让其他人觉得你落魄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这个人自负自傲，自私自利，简直无可救药。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的乐队到底意味着什么？哼，只是一群人用所谓的契约互相束缚，自娱自乐罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在她们都得到了幸福，自然就抛下你了。丰川祥子，你又是孤身一人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你相信爱丽丝说的那些话，那好，我为你重新准备了一场好梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它天衣无缝，就算你知道它是假的，你也不会愿意醒来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会和你的同伴们一样，沉溺其中，无法自拔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想说话？那就让你说最后一句。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"恶魔般的少女在空中比画了一个图案，仿佛解开了什么锁链。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"锁链又被狠狠地拉紧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，你还是不说话的时候比较可爱！"},{"type":"narration","text":"莫菲丝一步步靠近挣扎的祥子，她伸出了右手，放在了祥子的脸颊上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虚伪的公主啊，在你刚才漫游奇境时，我已经完全了解你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最渴望什么，你最需要什么，你最害怕什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心，这一次的梦，一定是完美的美梦。你会无比清醒，可你绝对不会想苏醒过来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉眠吧。高贵的、狡猾的、自私的，人偶少女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祝你，好梦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哐当，哐当。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，祥子？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_g1_transporter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是你说的那样——"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子失声叫了出来，可眼下她已不在城堡内，莫菲丝也消失得无影无踪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还好吗？你脸色很难看，是不是又做噩梦了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又......回到自己的梦里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么胡话，你这不是刚醒过来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是睡糊涂了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爱丽丝和贝娜也在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好......我好像还没自我介绍过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝娜","speakerId":"avg_369_bena_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们上车的时候，她好像已经睡着了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和红豆没有迟到......梦发生改变了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，你从刚才就一直在说一些奇怪的话——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们，这是要去维多利亚找安吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安是谁？爱丽丝你认识吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不认识。安是祥子小姐在小镇的朋友吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......？爱丽丝也不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我和红豆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是正好有派到你家附近的工作吗？我就想着让你也顺便回家休息休息，看望一下家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"avg_290_vigna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直忙于工作，祥子你也很久没有回过家了吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事，车怎么突然停了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝娜","speakerId":"avg_369_bena_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会爆胎了吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"司机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......呼......刚才差点撞上驮兽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"司机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好在有惊无险，我们马上重新上路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"随着发动机重新运作的声音，窗外的风景再次移动了起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"一模一样的荒原，一模一样的同行者。\n可梦境，已然发生偏差。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
